CORE
main.c
--show-uninitialized
activate-multi-line-match
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
\*\*\*\* \d+ file main\.c line 6 function main\nmain::1::uninitialized\n\n\s+// \d+ file main\.c line 6 function main\n\s+SET RETURN VALUE main::1::sum
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Of the local variables, only uninitialized is still uninitialized when sum is
returned.
